{"id": "1809615", "name": "חישוב ערכים עצמיים של מטריצה 3X3", "defaultgrade": 1, "penalty": 0.1, "options": {"multiplicationsign": "dot", "complexno": "i", "matrixparens": "[", "inversetrig": "cos-1", "logicsymbol": "lang", "sqrtsign": true}, "nhints": 0, "functions": [{"name": "lowerEntriesWithRandomDiag", "params": ["vals"], "body": "buildq([vals],lambda([i,j], if i<j then 0 else if i=j then rand(vals) else rand_with_prohib(-1,1,[0])))"}], "questiontext": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px\"><div style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#4b1f6f;margin-bottom:6px\">הנתונים</div><p>נתונה מטריצה <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(A\\in M_{3\\times 3}(\\mathbb{R})\\)</span>:</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[A={{CT:0}}\\]</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:14px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><p>מצאו את כל ערכי <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\lambda\\)</span> כך ש <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\det(\\lambda I- A)=0\\)</span>. נסמן ב <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(S\\)</span> את קבוצת ערכים אלו, מצאו את <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(S\\)</span>.</p><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">\\(S=\\) [[input:ans2]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans2]]</div><p class=\"input-hint input-hint-set\" dir=\"rtl\" style=\"font-size:0.88em;color:#555;margin:6px 0 0;text-align:right\">איך מזינים: האיברים בסוגריים מסולסלים, מופרדים בפסיקים. למשל <code dir=\"ltr\">{1,-2}</code>. קבוצה ריקה: <code dir=\"ltr\">{}</code>.</p><p style=\"font-size:0.92em;margin:8px 0 0\">הערה: תבנית התשובה <b>אינה</b> רומזת על מספר הערכים. במידת הצורך - הוסיפו/הורידו ערכים.</p></div></div>", "generalfeedback": "", "specificfeedback": "<br>[[feedback:prt2]]<br>", "prtcorrect": "Correct answer, well done.", "prtpartiallycorrect": "Your answer is partially correct.", "prtincorrect": "Incorrect answer.", "inputs": [{"name": "ans2", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 10, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "{?,?}", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}], "prts": [{"name": "prt2", "value": 1, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "flag2: is(ans2 = eigVals);", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "true", "tans": "flag2", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt2-1-T", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\">אלו אכן כל הערכים.</div>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt2-1-F", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\">זה לא הקבוצה <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(S\\)</span></div>"}}]}], "qvnames": ["A", "B", "P", "eigVals", "n"], "nvariants": 50}